hvariant=\"italic\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>21</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>17</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
